"both cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/vfio-user.rst:1536
msgid ""
"If the client has not shared mappable memory, the server can use this "
"message to write to guest memory. This message and its reply are passed over "
"the separate server-to-client socket if twin-socket mode has been negotiated "
"during connection setup."
msgstr ""

